(text "24 MHz crystal: ABM8-24.000MHZ-10-1-U-T, CL=10pF per Abracon test report." (at 15 253 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left)) (uuid b60adfba-639a-511e-b28e-7ff602b7da3a))
(text "Initial load capacitors 16pF each assume 2pF equivalent stray. Confirm frequency across tolerance and PCB parasitics." (at 15 258 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left)) (uuid 4840e998-5e6d-5c09-89c2-601eb97e353c))
(text "Each hub supply pin gets its own 100nF placed locally. 4.7uF is the local bulk capacitor." (at 15 263 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left)) (uuid 6e3c1472-39df-5ca6-9996-f68ed3af61ec))
